# LF everywhere. This repo is read on Windows, Linux and in cloud sessions, and the
# portability rule says tracked state must be identical on every machine. dksdk-coder
# carries assumptions (values_ast_has_unix_byte_positions,
# core_distribution_has_unix_byte_positions) that exist because CRLF changed byte offsets.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
